'''Choking Miasma''' and '''Inner Choking Miasma''' are [[debuff]]s from a modifier of the same name. Currently they can only be found in the [[Trials of Chaos]].

The modifier adds a cloud that follow the player character and deals [[chaos damage|chaos]] [[damage over time]] when the player character is inside the cloud. There are multiple tiers of the modifier, based on player selection during the trial, or scripted on the [[misc map item]] [[Inscribed Ultimatum]]:

* Choking Miasma I: A cloud that deals Chaos Damage over Time will follow you
* Choking Miasma II: A large cloud that deals Chaos Damage over Time will follow you
* Choking Miasma III: A large and fast cloud that deals Chaos Damage over Time will follow you

Likes the [[Deatomization Storm]], the tier 2 and 3 of Choking Miasma have inner ring and outer ring, which the inner ring deals more damage over time.
